Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:20:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Optional Linux diagnostics: interop dumps and submission log
 (off by default)

Squashes the two live-test diagnostic commits from 2026-10-26 (Kush J,
with Claude Sonnet 5): InteropTextureDumper, and RemixRenderer's
once-per-second camera/lights/chunks/submit/present summary. They found
the black interop image that the GL_DEDICATED_MEMORY_OBJECT_EXT fix
resolves.

Both are now off unless REMIX_LINUX_DIAGNOSTICS=1. Dumps go to
REMIX_LINUX_DIAG_DIR (default remix-diagnostics/ in the game directory)
instead of a fixed /mnt/big path, at 30 s, 2 min and 5 min after the
interop texture first appears. Success messages log at info, not error.

